## Daily workflow

```bash
# Start
pi main.py
docker compose up -d
source .venv/bin/activate

# Run notebook tests (SQLite in-memory, no Docker needed)
jupyter notebook notebooks/000_repositories.ipynb

# Stop Docker
docker compose down
```

